      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yileji anyana kaIsarela, wuyili neyi, Mwakashapa muchima kuhimulambu wami, yoyakudyayami yakunyilambu yami yakwila nakesi, yakunnunkishila ivumba dadiwahi, mwakanlambulaŋawu hachila aka chawu hachila aka chawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayilineyi, Tiyenu himulambu wakwila nakesi wumwakalambulaŋa Yehova; anyana kanyikoku ayizamba amwaka wumu akadi ninaha hatamawu, ifukudimu ayedi, ifuku dimu ayedi, hihimulambu wakushita wahefuku hefuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kamukoku wumu wakahimulambu laŋa habudidi, mwana kamukokumukwawu wakahimulambu laŋa hamelela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niibaŋu dawuŋa walembulu kawamulambu wawuŋa, wakubomba nachibalu chamuchiwana chanswaha yamanji akusohola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hihimulambu wakushita wahefuku hefuku, wayikaninuwu kumpidi yaSinayi kulonda ivumba dadiwahi, hihimulambu wakumwilila Yehova nakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulambu wawu wakuhupununa wakekalaŋa chibalu chanswaha chamuchiwana hamwana kamukoku wumu; mwajila dimu mwakahuŋunwina kudi Yehova himulambu wakuhuŋununa wawalwa washetana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kamukoku mukwawu wakahimulambu laŋa hamelela; wakalambulaŋa himulambu wowumu nawabudidi, hela wawuŋa hela wakuhuŋununa, hihimulambu wakwila nakesi, wakumununkishila Yehova ivumba dadiwahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku dasabata anyana kanyikoku ayizamba ayedi amwaka wumuakadi ninaha hataminawu, nimabaŋu ayedi awuŋa walembuluka wamulambu wawuŋa, wakubomba namanji, nihimulambu wawu wakuhuŋununa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weniwudiwu himulambu wakushita wahasabata hasabata, wakulunjika hahimulambu wakushita wahefuku hefuku nahimulambu wawu wakuhuŋununa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakutachika tukweji twenu mwakahimulambu laŋa Yehova himulambu wakushita; aŋombi amayala amayoŋa ayedi, nimukoku wachizamba wumu, anyana kanyikoku ayizamba amwaka wumu atanu nayedi akadi ninahahataminawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimabaŋu asatu awuŋa walembuluka wamulambu wawuŋa, wakubomba namanji, haŋombi, haŋombi; nimabaŋu ayedi awuŋa walembulukawamulambu wawuŋa, wakubomba namanji hachizamba chamukokuwumu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niibaŋu dimu dawuŋa walembuluka wiahimulambu wawuŋahamwana kamukoku, anyana kanyikoku ejima; hihimulambu wakushitawevumba dadiwahi, himulambu wakumwilila Yehova nakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyilambuyawu yakuhuŋununa yakekalaŋa chibalu chanswaha chahafu chavinyuhaŋombi wumu, chibalu chanswaha chamuchisatu hamukoku, chibalu chanswaha chamuchiwana hamwana kamukoku wumu; weniwu diwuhimulambu wakushita wahakakweji hakakweji mwahita tukweji twamumwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichizamba champembi wumu wakuhimulambu la Yehova himulambu wahanshidi; akahimulambu laŋa wakulunjika hahimulambu wakushita wahefukuhefuku, nahimulambu wawu wakuhuŋununa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakakweji kakusambila, hefuku dakakweji dekumi nakawana, hipaseka yambala yaYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku dekumi nakatanu dakakweji aka hakekalaŋa ŋehawŋia; akadyaŋa mankendi akadi iluŋi mafuku atanu nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefukudakusambila hakekalaŋa kupompa kwajila, kukoŋelamu nyidimu yaŋovunehi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chiŋa mwakalambulapa himulambu wakwila nakesi, himulambu wakumushitila Yehova; aŋombi amayala amayoŋa ayedi, chizamba chamukokuwumu, anyana kanyikoku ayizamba amwaka wumu atanu nayedi, yakekalaŋayenu yakadi ninaha hiyatamina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nihimulambu wawu wawuŋa, wuŋawalembuluka wakubomba namanji; mwakalambulaŋ mabaŋu asatuhaŋombi wumu, mabaŋu ayedi hamukoku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakalambula ibaŋu dimuhamwana kamukoku, anyana kanyikoku ejima atanu nayedi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichizambachampembi wumu wamulambu wahanshidi, kulonda kuyibuta nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeniyi mwakayilambulaŋa yakulunjika hahimulambu wakushita wahabudidi, wamulambu wakushita wahefuku hefuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya mumwakalambwilaŋahefuku hefuku, mumafuku atanu nayedi, yakudya yahimulambu wakwilanakesi, yakumununkishila Yehova ivumba dadiwahi; akayilambulaŋa yakulunjika hahimulambu wakushita wahefuku hefuku, nahimulambu wawu wakuhupununa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku damu chitanu nachiyedi mwakapompaŋa kupompakwajila, kukoŋelamu nyidimu yaŋovu nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
